===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|obsolete|intransitive|lang=en}} To be disquieted or confused; to be in commotion.
#: {{rfquotek|Milton}}
# {{context|obsolete|transitive|lang=en}} To harass with commotion; to disquiet; to worry.
#* Spenser
#*: It is her fatal misfortune {{...}} to be miserably tossed and '''turmoiled''' with these storms of affliction.

